    <briefdescription>
<para>generalized Gauss-Hermite integration </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class performs a 1-dimensional Gauss-Hermite integration. <formula id="193">\[ \int_{-\inf}^{\inf} f(x) \mathrm{d}x \]</formula> The weighting function is <formula id="194">\[ w(x;\mu)=|x|^{2\mu} \exp{-x*x} \]</formula> and <formula id="195">\[ \mu &gt; -0.5 \]</formula> </para>    </detaileddescription>
